.\" Manual page for colorful(1)
.TH COLORFUL 1 "March 2024" "colorful 1.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
colorful \- highlight source code in the terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B colorful
[\fB\-l\fR \fIlanguage\fR]
[\fB\-\-theme\fR=\fIname\fR]
.IR file ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B colorful
reads each \fIfile\fP and writes it to standard output with
\fBsyntax highlighting\fR applied.  \" an inline comment
The default theme is \*(Th and the width is \n(LL units.
.PP
Special characters such as \(em dashes and \[u00E9] work too.
.SS Options
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-lang " \fIlanguage\fP"
Force the language instead of guessing it.
.TP
.B \-\-list
List all supported languages.
.sp 2
.IP \(bu 4
Bullet item one.
.RS
.nf
colorful \-l rust src/main.rs
.fi
.RE
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR bat (1),
.BR less (1)
